# Entries mise-tmpl-gen (wt mode) merges into <project>/.worktreeinclude —
# the allowlist Worktrunk's `wt step copy-ignored --require-include` copies
# into every new worktree. Merging is additive: project-local entries are
# never removed. Comments and blank lines here are ignored.
#
# deps/ and _build/ seed the Mix caches copy-on-write (Worktrunk clones via
# reflink/clonefile on APFS), eliminating the fresh-worktree cold start;
# `mix deps.get` + `mix compile` in dev:setup validate the seeded cache.
.config/
.env
.envrc
deps/
_build/
